WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.400
 Ladies and gentlemen, what a great honor for me this evening to end up at the

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.000
 Cleveland Hall of Fame.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
 Amen for all seasons. Arnie de la Porte.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.980
 I know as we go through our life's journey, we meet various people, such as As

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:36.980
 others we see sometimes, but others leave an everlasting memory.

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:44.980
 I, as an entrepreneur many years ago, met this evening's inductee, and I was

00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:45.000
 introduced to him as a man of the

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.560
 romantic network contacts, and then I find out that all of his contacts are his

00:00:52.560 --> 00:01:02.000
 friends, and you wonder how is all that

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:12.290
 possible? Yes, it's not easy. Only a few people walk the walk that Arnie de la

00:01:12.290 --> 00:01:14.000
 Porte walked.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:26.000
 He had many accomplishments. His life vision was to help others. He had many

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:29.980
 dreams. His biggest dream was to have the

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:39.140
 Cleveland Port as the best container port in the Great Lakes. His other dream

00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:41.980
 was to build Cleveland as a big

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:52.270
 international community, and many, many others. He loved his homeland, the

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:54.980
 Netherlands. He served as an honorary

00:01:54.980 --> 00:02:01.300
 consul for the Netherlands. He was an active member of the Cleveland Rotary

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:04.980
 Club, the Cuyahoga County

00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:13.980
 Senea Railroad International Business Network, I can just go on and on and on.

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:20.980
 This evening, I applaud Arnie de la Porte, a

00:02:20.980 --> 00:02:29.340
 man whose footsteps are left for us to continue his walk here in the city of

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:32.980
 Cleveland, and I congratulate his son who

00:02:32.980 --> 00:02:35.980
 will be receiving the award.

